{"id":"7b29c798e40853c1","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-variableidentification.md","title":"Variable identification and addition of inessential variables","display":"df-variableidentification — Variable identification and addition of inessential variables","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-variableidentification","aliases":["27-df-variableidentification"],"display":"df-variableidentification — Variable identification and addition of inessential variables","depends_on":["[[27-df-equationalclass]]","[[27-df-boolfunc]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§11.4 Definitions 11.6–11.7","source_printed_pages":"495–496","source_pdf_pages":"519–520","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-with-zero-arity-boundary","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-variableidentification"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-variableidentification</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-variableidentification — Variable identification and addition of inessential variables"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6afd580565e13acf\" href=\"?note=6afd580565e13acf\" title=\"27-df-equationalclass\">27-df-equationalclass</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§11.4 Definitions 11.6–11.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"495–496"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"519–520"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-with-zero-arity-boundary"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,m,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,m,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathbb B^m\">\\(x\\in\\mathbb B^m\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\\in\\mathbb B^{n+k}\">\\(z\\in\\mathbb B^{n+k}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[r]=\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\">\\([r]=\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq\\mathcal U_+\">\\(K\\subseteq\\mathcal U_+\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K_n\">\\(K_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U_+\">\\(\\mathcal U_+\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6afd580565e13acf\" href=\"?note=6afd580565e13acf\" title=\"27-df-equationalclass\">27-df-equationalclass</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[m]^{[n]}\">\\([m]^{[n]}\\)</span> 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]\">\\([n]\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[m]\">\\([m]\\)</span> 的全函数集合，本节定义一元谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IdClosed}_+\">\\(\\mathrm{IdClosed}_+\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PadClosed}_+\">\\(\\mathrm{PadClosed}_+\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+\">\\(\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,m}\\coloneqq\\{r\\in[m]^{[n]}\\mid \\{r(i)\\mid i\\in[n]\\}=[m]\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,m}\\coloneqq\\{r\\in[m]^{[n]}\\mid \\{r(i)\\mid i\\in[n]\\}=[m]\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_r:\\mathbb B^m\\to\\mathbb B^n,\\qquad\\Delta_r(x)\\coloneqq(x_{r(i)})_{i\\in[n]}\\quad(r\\in\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,m}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_r:\\mathbb B^m\\to\\mathbb B^n,\\qquad\\Delta_r(x)\\coloneqq(x_{r(i)})_{i\\in[n]}\\quad(r\\in\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,m}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Id}_r(f)\\coloneqq\\{(x,f(\\Delta_r(x)))\\mid x\\in\\mathbb B^m\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,m}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Id}_r(f)\\coloneqq\\{(x,f(\\Delta_r(x)))\\mid x\\in\\mathbb B^m\\}\\quad(r\\in\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,m}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pad}_{n,k}(f)\\coloneqq\\{(z,f(z_1,\\ldots,z_n))\\mid z\\in\\mathbb B^{n+k}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Pad}_{n,k}(f)\\coloneqq\\{(z,f(z_1,\\ldots,z_n))\\mid z\\in\\mathbb B^{n+k}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IdClosed}_+(K)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n,m\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\forall f\\in K_n\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,m}\\;(\\mathrm{Id}_r(f)\\in K_m).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IdClosed}_+(K)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n,m\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\forall f\\in K_n\\;\\forall r\\in\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,m}\\;(\\mathrm{Id}_r(f)\\in K_m).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PadClosed}_+(K)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\in K_n\\;(\\mathrm{Pad}_{n,k}(f)\\in K_{n+k}),\\qquad\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+(K)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{IdClosed}_+(K)\\land\\mathrm{PadClosed}_+(K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PadClosed}_+(K)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f\\in K_n\\;(\\mathrm{Pad}_{n,k}(f)\\in K_{n+k}),\\qquad\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+(K)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{IdClosed}_+(K)\\land\\mathrm{PadClosed}_+(K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Definitions 11.6–11.7，印刷 pp.495–496／PDF pp.519–520。识别映射须满射，双射给变元置换；它只选择、复制输入坐标，不准取补，也不准代入常数。添加 k=0 是恒等操作，是原书 k&gt;0 的无害补充。公式给出完整函数图，故存在且单值；Δᵣ 的单射性来自 r 的满射性。</p>\n<p>本地允许定义 IdMap₀,₀={∅}、Id∅ 及从零元函数添加无关变量；n&gt;0 时 IdMapₙ,₀ 为空。后续一般表征定理仅使用正元数闭包，不把常元替换与变元识别混为一谈。原书 Definition 11.7 的“produced from g”按公式应是从 f 添加无关变量。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-equationalclass","status":"resolved","id":"6afd580565e13acf","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-equationalclass]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[