,k}(f)\\in K_{n+k}),\\qquad\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+(K)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathrm{IdClosed}_+(K)\\land\\mathrm{PadClosed}_+(K).","display":true}],"bytes":2782,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-362","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-variableidentification|df-variableidentification — Variable identification and addition of inessential variables]]"},{"id":"b2aa62f1a3d9ec85","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K\\subseteq\\mathcal U_+$；$\\mathrm{EqDef}_+$、$\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+$、$\\mathrm{Id}_r$、$\\mathrm{Pad}_{n,k}$ 见 [[27-df-variableidentification]]；$\\models_n$、$\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}$ 分别见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]、[[27-df-vectorinterpretation]]。"},{"id":"7ef17f865bf13a3e","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K\\subseteq\\mathcal U_+$；$\\mathrm{Char}_+$、$\\mathrm{FinEqDef}_+$、$K_n$ 见 [[27-df-equationalclass]]；$\\nu$、$\\mathrm{FEq}$ 见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]；$\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+$ 见 [[27-df-variableidentification]]；$\\mathrm{NonMemberCert}_n$、$\\mathrm{BoundedCert}_+$ 见 [[27-df-nonmembershipcertificate]]。$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$ 为 [[27-df-boolfunc]] 的函数集合，$\\mathrm{Fin}(A)$ 为 [[27-df-equationalclass]] 的有限子集集合。对有限方程集 $I$，$c_I$ 由下式定义。"},{"id":"9f83e5a1d0632c23","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$e\\in\\mathrm{FEq}$、$\\nu(e)=m$，$g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$，$Y\\in(\\mathbb B^n)^m$ 且 $L_{e,n}(g,Y)\\ne R_{e,n}(g,Y)$。方程求值见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]；$\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,q},\\mathrm{Id}_r$ 见 [[27-df-variableidentification]]。列向量 $C_i$、列型数 $q$、合法编号集合 $\\mathcal R_Y$ 及各编号对应的压缩赋值 $Y^{(r)}$ 由下式构造。"},{"id":"5810614a217ff037","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge1}$，$k\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$；$f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$，$(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)$，$r\\in\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,m}$。$\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$、$\\mathrm{Sep}$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]；$\\mathrm{IdMap}_{n,m}$、$\\mathrm{Id}_r$、$\\mathrm{Pad}_{n,k}$、$\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+$ 见 [[27-df-variableidentification]]，$\\mathrm{EqDef}_+$ 见 [[27-df-equationalclass]]。对 $j\\in[m]$ 引入权向量 $w'\\in\\mathbb R^m$；$0^k\\in\\mathbb R^k$ 是零向量，$w\\mathbin{\\frown}0^k\\in\\mathbb R^{n+k}$ 的坐标图由下式构造。"}],"outgoing":["6afd580565e13acf","5d10aed668d85817"]}